        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #0E1C42; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 10px;">A few words in this lesson are worth reviewing before you read. They are shown in bold with a dotted line. Hover over one to see what it means.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Black Codes</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of Black Codes" onclick="speakGloss(event,'Black Codes')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(BLAK KOHDZ)</span>: Laws passed in Southern states in 1865 and 1866 that limited the rights of freed people.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Freedmen&#x27;s Bureau</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of Freedmen&#x27;s Bureau" onclick="speakGloss(event,'Freedmen&#x27;s Bureau')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(FREED-menz BYOOR-oh)</span>: A federal agency set up to help formerly enslaved people after the war.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>freedpeople</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of freedpeople" onclick="speakGloss(event,'freedpeople')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(FREED-pee-pul)</span>: People who had been enslaved and were now free.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Reconstruction</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of Reconstruction" onclick="speakGloss(event,'Reconstruction')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(ree-kun-STRUK-shun)</span>: The years after the Civil War when the nation worked out how to bring the South back into the Union.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>Redemption</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of Redemption" onclick="speakGloss(event,'Redemption')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(ree-DEMP-shun)</span>: The name Democrats gave to their return to power in the South at the end of Reconstruction.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>sharecropping</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of sharecropping" onclick="speakGloss(event,'sharecropping')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(SHAIR-krop-ing)</span>: A farming system where a family works land owned by someone else and pays with part of the crop.</div>
